# Bergitte Aukland - the common ancestor of Emma and Arne Garborg who is herself
# descended from Charlemagne. Emma, queue.md: "they are not the person who is the
# nearest common ancestor of me and Arne, but they are the common ancestor in the two
# lines between me and Arne who is a descendant of Charlemagne."
#
# She has NO Wikidata item and neither do her parents, her husband or her four
# children, so there is nothing on Wikidata to link her to yet. This creates her; the
# relationships follow once the people around her exist.
#
# Checked before writing: no P2600 anywhere carries her Geni id, and the duplicate
# guard finds no candidate item, because none of her relatives has an item whose
# child/parent/spouse slots could hold her.

